{"product_id":"hyde-closer-vol-4-4","title":"Hyde \u0026 Closer, Vol. 4 (4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe magic journey of a boy and his chain saw-wielding bear!Shunpei Closer is your average...well, slightly below average kid in junior high who finds himself in the middle of a great battle of dark sorcery. With cursed dolls coming after him one after another, Shunpei Closer's life is in danger! If that weren't enough, Hyde, the teddy bear given to him by his grandfather, suddenly comes alive to rescue him. With Hyde's help, can Shunpei save himself and live to see another day?A reformed hoodlum is powerless to stop an unscrupulous sorcerer who can break his opponent's bones with a chance roll of a die. But should a guardian angel happen to appear with a chainsaw in hand, maybe luck will be on his side…\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Haro Aso\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421534275\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45390169899161,"sku":"Manga-A-4-9781421534275","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68246b527f216-Hyde-Closer-Vol-4-4-1-_1.jpg?v=1748277370","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/hyde-closer-vol-4-4","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}